neutron_uapi.h mirrors the Neutron kernel driver's userspace API header
(SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0+ WITH Linux-syscall-note, Copyright 2023-2024 NXP);
the syscall note permits its use by userspace programs.

At build and run time the backend uses NXP's NeutronDriver.h (BSD-3-Clause) and
libNeutronDriver.so from the NXP Linux BSP. Neither is included in this repository.
